    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesnt feel like a strength though. it feels like i'm just dragging them down. every time i struggle or cant make things work, i see it in their eyes. they’re better off with someone who actually has it together. i feel like the most selfless thing i could do is stop being the reason they're struggling",
