      "content": "The weight of their perceived disappointment is crushing you, but that feeling is a distortion of reality. Your presence is a constant, and the effort you put in, even when it feels messy, is what they need, not some perfect stranger. Think about how much more pain you'll cause yourself by trying to vanish; you deserve to be cared for, too. Reaching out to a professional can help you manage this overwhelming sense of failure.",
