    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but i dont want to be cared for. that's the thing. caring for me is just another bill they cant afford, another worry on their mind. if i was just gone, they wouldn't have to worry about me anymore. they could just focus on being happy. wouldn't it be easier for everyone if i just wasn't here to mess things up?",
